message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Disclosed vs Exposed: physical climate risk at Nigeria's listed companies ahead of IFRS S2"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Badmus
    given-names: Malik Kolawole
    affiliation: "Independent researcher"
date-released: 2026-11-18
repository-code: "https://github.com/malikbadmus79-max/disclosed-vs-exposed"
url: "https://github.com/malikbadmus79-max/disclosed-vs-exposed"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A descriptive study of 56 Nigerian Exchange companies with physical operations (2020-2025) comparing their
  physical climate-risk disclosure with the open-data hazard exposure of the sites they name, as a baseline
  before mandatory IFRS S2 reporting in Nigeria (2028).
keywords:
  - IFRS S2
  - physical climate risk
  - corporate disclosure
  - Nigeria
  - decoupling
